WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.368
-Mike, you look fantastic,
buddy.

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:03.736
Thank you so much
for doing our show.

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:05.037
-Jimmy, I feel fantastic, man.

00:00:05.037 --> 00:00:05.805
Oh, man, I can't wait
till you see me in the ring

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:07.139
and do my thing.

00:00:07.139 --> 00:00:11.944
-I can't believe you that did
this thing on Shark Week.

00:00:11.944 --> 00:00:13.013
-Hey, listen.

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:15.681
My wife talked me
into doing this, said,

00:00:15.681 --> 00:00:18.517
"Hey, Will Smith did it,
and he did it,

00:00:18.517 --> 00:00:21.353
and he didn't complain.
Why are you going to complain?"

00:00:21.353 --> 00:00:24.357
And I said Will Smith is
a different kind of guy.

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:26.826
He's adventurous.
I'm not adventurous.

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:27.994
-Yeah, me neither.

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:30.396
-She convinced me to go
on this trip.

00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:34.834
So, I'm in the Bahamas,
and she accompanied me

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:37.103
in the Bahamas,
so we went to the Bahamas,

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:40.273
and man, first I was in the cage
with the shark,

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:42.408
and that was
kind of claustrophobic.

00:00:42.408 --> 00:00:44.010
It wasn't fun and exciting.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:47.047
And then I did the free dive,

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:48.915
and I was hanging out
with some sharks.

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:50.182
-No, no, no.

00:00:50.182 --> 00:00:52.585
People from Brooklyn
should not do that.

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:54.954
-Hey, listen, I understand.

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:57.957
But my wife felt
it was a way for me

00:00:57.957 --> 00:01:00.660
to overcome my fears, and I did.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:01.995
Yeah, she was right.

00:01:01.995 --> 00:01:03.896
-Wow. It must have been amazing.

00:01:03.896 --> 00:01:06.365
You must be happy that
you did it now that it's over.

00:01:06.365 --> 00:01:09.568
-Oh, listen, I'm very satisfied
that I did it and I survived.

00:01:09.568 --> 00:01:10.970
-[ Laughs ] Yeah, exactly.

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:13.172
-Because the most frightening
thing was

00:01:13.172 --> 00:01:15.641
when I was at the bottom of
the sea and I looked up,

00:01:15.641 --> 00:01:19.678
and man, it was like 50 feet up,
and I'm sitting there,

00:01:19.678 --> 00:01:22.515
"How can I make it up
if my tank don't leak,"

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:25.117
and I'm just saying --
I don't know.

00:01:25.117 --> 00:01:28.154
I'm not a water guy.
-No.

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:30.423
-And I was happy to do it.

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:33.393
I overcame so many fears.
You couldn't believe it.

00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:35.562
-It's gonna be on
Discovery Channel,

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:38.264
"Tyson Versus Jaws:
A Rumble in the Reef."

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:40.466
Mike, since you're facing up
against Jaws

00:01:40.466 --> 00:01:43.636
and then against Roy Jones Jr.,
I want to get your take

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:46.572
and see if you think you
can beat a few other legends.

00:01:46.572 --> 00:01:47.740
Are you up for that?

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:48.841
-I'm ready, man.

00:01:48.841 --> 00:01:50.710
I think I can beat anybody
that ever lived.

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:52.378
-Alright, ready for this?
-Yeah.

00:01:52.378 --> 00:01:55.949
-Mike Tyson versus Rocky Balboa.

00:01:55.949 --> 00:01:58.350
-Man, I will kick Rocky's butt,
man.

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:00.653
-Oh, come on.
-I will lay him out.

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:02.721
-Come on, though.
-Yeah, dude.

00:02:02.721 --> 00:02:04.924
-[ Laughs ]
But no one knows his style.

00:02:04.924 --> 00:02:07.160
He's an underdog.
He came from nowhere.

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:12.198
-No, dude, I would slaughter,
slaughter, slaughter, slaughter.

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:14.533
I win, I win, I win.

00:02:14.533 --> 00:02:16.702
-Okay, how about this,
sticking with "Rocky" movies,

00:02:16.702 --> 00:02:21.708
how about Drago, Ivan Drago,
from "Rocky IV"?

00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:25.845
-Oh, man, too slow, dude,
too many muscles.

00:02:25.845 --> 00:02:28.914
-Yeah, yeah.
I knew that, but alright.

00:02:28.914 --> 00:02:31.250
How about this one?
This one actually could happen.

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:34.487
Mike Tyson versus
Conor McGregor?

00:02:34.487 --> 00:02:36.522
-Wow. Look at that.

00:02:36.522 --> 00:02:38.924
-Yeah. That dude's nuts.

00:02:38.924 --> 00:02:41.127
-Yeah, but I'm gonna
kick his ass anyway.

00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:44.964
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:46.799
But he doesn't
play by the rules.

00:02:46.799 --> 00:02:50.402
He's all MMA and stuff.
You're a boxer.

00:02:50.402 --> 00:02:52.672
-Hey, we gonna play with
boxing rules.

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:54.807
-Well, there you go.
That one could happen.

00:02:54.807 --> 00:02:56.442
Finally, how about this?
Last one.

00:02:56.442 --> 00:02:59.779
Mike Tyson versus
the Karate Kid?

00:02:59.779 --> 00:03:00.947
-Whoa.

00:03:00.947 --> 00:03:02.581
Wax off, wax on.

00:03:02.581 --> 00:03:04.483
This looks pretty complicated.

00:03:04.483 --> 00:03:06.586
I'm going to have to surrender
to him on this one.

00:03:06.586 --> 00:03:08.487
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:08.487 --> 00:03:10.957
-Hey, but then again,
we must have to know.

00:03:10.957 --> 00:03:12.791
It's gonna me and Roy Jones.

00:03:12.791 --> 00:03:14.694
And it's gonna be
an eight-round exhibition,

00:03:14.694 --> 00:03:16.329
and it's gonna be magnificent

00:03:16.329 --> 00:03:17.896
and I'm gonna look beautiful,

00:03:17.896 --> 00:03:22.335
and the venue's gonna be
the Dignity Health Sports Park.

00:03:22.335 --> 00:03:23.903
And this is going to be awesome.

00:03:23.903 --> 00:03:25.138
Let me say that one more time.

00:03:25.138 --> 00:03:27.639
Dignity Health Sports Park.

00:03:27.639 --> 00:03:29.074
This is where it's at.

00:03:29.074 --> 00:03:31.577
-September 12th.
-Yes.

00:03:31.577 --> 00:03:32.812
-Best of luck, my friend.
Thank you so much.

00:03:32.812 --> 00:03:34.747
-Dignity Health Sports Park.

00:03:34.747 --> 00:03:37.516
And listen, I love you,
and listen, man, try to come.

00:03:37.516 --> 00:03:40.420
If not, you have to go
to pay-per-view

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:42.722
on Triller with Innovation.

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:45.591
We're kicking ass, man, okay?
-Yep.

00:03:45.591 --> 00:03:48.428
Eon's. Forgive me.
Eon's Innovations. Forgive me.

00:03:48.428 --> 00:03:50.430
We're kicking ass.
-Mike Tyson, everybody.

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:53.366
-Eros, Eros, Eros Innovation,
Eros Innovation.

00:03:53.366 --> 00:03:54.867
I love you guys.
-"Tyson Versus Jaws:

00:03:54.867 --> 00:03:57.303
Rumble on the Reef" August 9th
on Discovery,

00:03:57.303 --> 00:03:59.939
and catch Mike's return
to the ring September 12th

00:03:59.939 --> 00:04:01.774
on pay-per-view and Triller.

00:04:01.774 --> 00:04:04.043
We'll be right back
with Adam Devine, everybody!

